                                                "sense_id": "ce87fe6c-c0b3-3438-8c3d-9597aded3cc6",
                                                "text": "Born Margarita Carmen Cansino to Eduardo and Volga Haworth Cansino on October 17, 1918, in New York City, Rita Hayworth was no stranger to show business."
                                            }
                                        ]
